 "_": "How to watch a network from Lincoln, for the live game block (app.js renderTeamLive). Keys are regexes matched against ESPN's broadcast names, case-insensitive; first match wins. DirecTV and Dish numbers are the national ones; no Xfinity lineup or over-the-air station numbers yet for Nebraska (lqa's scripts/xfinity-lineup.mjs can build one from tvtv.us for an Omaha or Lincoln zip); stream = the services that carry it. A streaming-only service lists just its name; apps = device → the page to install its app from.",
 "_bars": "bars = the commercial service a venue subscribes to for it: EverPass carries the streaming-only games (Sunday Ticket, the Peacock, Netflix and Prime games, Apple's MLS) to bars and restaurants; it does not carry cable networks like BTN. DAZN agreed to buy it in August 2026. app.js buildStreamList prints it as \"bars: EverPass\" after the ways.",
